structured-stemmers is maintained at https://github.com/structured-world/rust-stemmers.
It derives from CurrySoftware/rust-stemmers, copyright 2017 Jakob Demler (MIT).
The stemming implementations derive from the Snowball project
(https://snowballstem.org/) and retain its BSD-3-Clause license.
Algorithms and Rust runtime are derived from snowballstem/snowball main commit
6389c79f91cd67ed2de3ebdcf84ec8c2d2d23c11, including the upstream Ukrainian
algorithm. Generated source headers identify the generating Snowball version.
snowball.lock.json records this revision and the independently pinned reference
corpus revision. Reference corpora and their separate licenses are not included
in the library archive.

The package retains both LICENSE and LICENSE-SNOWBALL. The Cargo license
expression describes the combined distribution; it does not relicense upstream
components or grant either upstream license over the other component.
